      "init": {
        "label": "Every relational table verb",
        "body": "# One source → every verb\nThe **Sales** frame feeds each table verb on its own branch; a chip opens the full table. **Reps** is the Join lookup; **More Sales** is the Append bottom. A row is duplicated (Ada/N/100) for Distinct; Pivot→Unpivot and Nest→Unnest are round-trips. Column lists are typed right in the node, e.g. `Rep, Amount`.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sales",
      "type": "FrameInputNode",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -350,
      "init": {
